        "meta_descr": "Gelagen is a biotin and B-vitamin gummy made for daily use. Read about ingredients, package options, shipping, and the 60-day refund promise.",
        "header_custom": "<meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"gelagen, gelagen gummies, gelagen reviews, gelagen ingredients, gelagen biotin gummies, hair skin and nails supplement, biotin gummies, B-vitamin gummies, gelagen money-back guarantee\n\">\n<meta name=\"author\"content=\"Gelagen\">\n\n<link rel=\"canonical\"herf=\"\">",
