          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article07\" group=\"Article\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Content Width\" name=\"contentWidth\" min=\"8\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"12\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Wrap Bg\" name=\"wrapBgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.3\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"card col-md-12 col-lg-{{contentWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n          <h3 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mbr-white mt-3 mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-box\">\n            <b>Delivery Terms:</b>\n          </h3>\n          <div class=\"row card-box align-left\">\n            <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 active\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>How Safe Is My Credit Card Information on Your Website?&nbsp;</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Gelagen is a dietary supplement in chewable gummy form, created for people who want to support the look and feel of their skin, hair, and nails through daily nutrition. Instead of depending only on creams, serums, or salon treatments that work on the surface, Gelagen provides nutrients that your body absorbs through digestion and uses where they are needed. Each gummy is designed to be tasty and convenient, so taking it feels less like a chore and more like a small, enjoyable habit. It is meant to be used every day as part of a balanced diet and a healthy lifestyle.\n<br>\n<br>The formula is built around biotin, a B-vitamin closely associated with the normal upkeep of hair, skin, and nails. Alongside it, Gelagen includes vitamin B12 as methylcobalamin, vitamin B6 as pyridoxine hydrochloride, folate, and pantothenic acid as d-calcium pantothenate. Each of these nutrients plays a recognized role in the body, from supporting normal cell renewal to helping convert food into energy. By combining them in a single serving, Gelagen offers a simple way to cover several nutritional needs at once, without forcing you to buy and manage multiple separate supplements.\n<br>\n<br>Skin, hair, and nails are among the fastest-renewing tissues in your body, which means they depend on a steady supply of nutrients. When your diet falls short because of busy schedules, stress, or limited food variety, these tissues may be among the first to show it. Gelagen is designed to help fill that gap. It works from the inside, supporting the processes your body already uses to build keratin and renew cells, rather than only changing how things look on the surface for a few hours.\n<br>\n<br>Gelagen is made for adults who want an easy, consistent beauty-from-within routine. Many people prefer gummies because there are no large capsules to swallow and the flavor makes them pleasant to take. A common approach is to take it at the same time each day, such as with breakfast, so it becomes automatic. Always follow the serving size printed on your bottle. If you are pregnant, nursing, taking medication, or have a medical condition, speak with your doctor before starting any new supplement, including Gelagen.\n<br>\n<br>It is important to have realistic expectations. Hair and nails grow slowly, so most people allow at least eight to twelve weeks of steady daily use before judging results, and individual outcomes vary with diet, age, genetics, and lifestyle. To help you try it with confidence, every order is backed by a 60-day money-back guarantee, so you can see how it fits into your routine.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            \n          </div>\n          <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n            <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Start Now</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
